              "code": "# 受控反例：发布者仍是transient_local，但晚加入订阅只请求volatile。\n# 策略可相容却不请求早先的历史样本；本例不会再次发布静态状态。\n/bag_lab/static:\n  history: keep_last\n  depth: 1\n  reliability: reliable\n  durability: volatile\n",
              "sourceSha256": "ab8ba5c7566fed287566a3f0949763c83b94961b2774da3e41485996e6cdfc00"
