              "code": "# CMakeLists.txt：先发现依赖，再建立目标，最后安装二进制和 launch 文件。\ncmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.8)\nproject(atlas_plan_demo)\nfind_package(ament_cmake REQUIRED)\nfind_package(rclcpp REQUIRED)\nfind_package(moveit_ros_planning_interface REQUIRED)\nadd_executable(plan_ready src/plan_ready.cpp)\ntarget_compile_features(plan_ready PUBLIC cxx_std_17)\nament_target_dependencies(plan_ready rclcpp moveit_ros_planning_interface)\n# ros2 run 从 lib/包名 查找可执行文件；不是直接运行 src 里的源码。\ninstall(TARGETS plan_ready DESTINATION lib/${PROJECT_NAME})\ninstall(DIRECTORY launch DESTINATION share/${PROJECT_NAME})\nament_package()\n",
              "explanation": "构建输入为 src/plan_ready.cpp，输出安装后的 plan_ready 可执行文件与启动资源。"
